# Universal Authentication Backend — Migration Notes

## Project Goal

Build a **production-grade, reusable Universal Authentication Backend**.

### Final Stack

* Cloudflare Workers
* Hono
* Cloudflare D1
* Brevo
* JWT
* Web Crypto API

---

# Final Architecture

```text
Frontend
    │
    ▼
Cloudflare Worker
    │
Controller
    │
Service
    │
Repository
    │
Database Provider
    │
Cloudflare D1
```

This architecture should remain unchanged.

---

# Why We Migrated

## Before

```text
Cloudflare Workers
        ↓
MongoDB Node Driver
        ↓
MongoDB Atlas
```

Problem:

* MongoDB driver caused Worker runtime issues.
* "Too many subrequests by single Worker invocation"
* Unstable for Cloudflare Workers.

---

## After

```text
Cloudflare Workers
        ↓
Cloudflare D1
```

Benefits:

* Native Cloudflare database
* No MongoDB connection management
* Runs 24×7
* Completely free
* Better production fit for Workers

